  "instance_name": "false_equivalence",
  "label": "False Equivalence",
  "description": "A logical fallacy that occurs when two different things are presented as being equivalent or comparable, even though they are fundamentally different. The meme commits this fallacy by equating the U.S. government with the Soviet Union, which are vastly different political systems with different historical contexts, to make a point about government control. This is a misleading and oversimplified comparison.",
